715
00:54:20,999 --> 00:54:22,625
Un beso con lengua.

716
00:54:24,669 --> 00:54:26,087
Ok.

717
00:54:27,755 --> 00:54:29,257
¿Sí?

718
00:54:31,134 --> 00:54:32,302
Sí.

719
